{"obsah":"<p>For everyone who's bored over the summer holidays, as well as enthusiasts who want to perfect their technique, we prepared a small camp in the middle of the holidays. Katarína Tóthová took charge of the group of women and girls, and Vlasta looked after a group of bike-hungry guys. The weather was a bit disappointing, with beautiful sunshine alternating with local showers. Luckily it didn't affect morale, so the rainy breaks were used for a small workshop or a chat. Thanks to everyone for taking part – keep polishing your newly acquired skills.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F20230730_114213-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F20230730_114213.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237874\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F20230730_091619-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F20230730_091619.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237875\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F20230730_091645-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F08%2F20230730_091645.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237876\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.g